(4409104, 636156, 55956, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the shot is well done. my only question is on the positions of the cards. Is better the natural reflection or perhaps could be better the reflected image? probably if you use the 9 in the low side of the glass we could see the 6(but this is only an academic question). 7</td>', 'I like the idea and the shot is well done. my only question is on the positions of the cards. Is better the natural reflection or perhaps could be better the reflected image? probably if you use the 9 in the low side of the glass we could see the 6(but this is only an academic question). 7', '2008-01-21 05:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
