(4409220, 635155, 68035, '<td valign="top">This looks like a wonderfully abstract piece of public art.  Lovely sky capture which helps set off the divers well, although somehow they perhaps lack the touch of pop that would turn this from a good into a great image.  I wonder what this might have looked like in Black and White so you could have really played with the contrast levels etc<br/> <br/>Love the leading diagonals and very good composition to get all the figures framed so well within the image</td>', 'This looks like a wonderfully abstract piece of public art.  Lovely sky capture which helps set off the divers well, although somehow they perhaps lack the touch of pop that would turn this from a good into a great image.  I wonder what this might have looked like in Black and White so you could have really played with the contrast levels etc Love the leading diagonals and very good composition to get all the figures framed so well within the image', '2008-01-21 06:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
