(4409351, 634982, 51793, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot but there is a lot going on. I like the duotone to the image but blur doesn''t look right. If you look close enough you can see where the blur line is and I think that is why it doesn''t look natural. <br/> <br/>GL</td>', 'This is a really good shot but there is a lot going on. I like the duotone to the image but blur doesn''t look right. If you look close enough you can see where the blur line is and I think that is why it doesn''t look natural.  GL', '2008-01-21 08:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
