(4409387, 635871, 51793, '<td valign="top">The crop isn''t exactly right and this is one of those pictures that you would want it perfect on. Besides that the lighting isn''t right either. See the glare of the light on the lower right side of the plate and not on the upper left side? Instead of shining the light right on the subject you should have bounced it off the ceiling and used a reflector to control the light better. <br/> <br/>If you don''t have a reflector, you could use aluminum foil, or a mirror. Anything that will reflect light. <br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge</td>', 'The crop isn''t exactly right and this is one of those pictures that you would want it perfect on. Besides that the lighting isn''t right either. See the glare of the light on the lower right side of the plate and not on the upper left side? Instead of shining the light right on the subject you should have bounced it off the ceiling and used a reflector to control the light better.  If you don''t have a reflector, you could use aluminum foil, or a mirror. Anything that will reflect light.  Good luck with the challenge', '2008-01-21 08:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4409396, 636143, 51793, '<td valign="top">I am assuming that the jeans that she has on is a size 6? If not I think this is a bad shoehorn idea. The crop is tight, some of her tat is cut off and there is a Kleenex hanging out of her back pocket. The lighting is a bit off casting a shadow on the upper half of her legs and just under her butt. I think that with a little more planning you could have really turned this into something much more.</td>', 'I am assuming that the jeans that she has on is a size 6? If not I think this is a bad shoehorn idea. The crop is tight, some of her tat is cut off and there is a Kleenex hanging out of her back pocket. The lighting is a bit off casting a shadow on the upper half of her legs and just under her butt. I think that with a little more planning you could have really turned this into something much more.', '2008-01-21 08:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4409399, 636119, 51793, '<td valign="top">I sure hope that is budlight. If not then I will come back and give you a 1 for a DNMC. :)</td>', 'I sure hope that is budlight. If not then I will come back and give you a 1 for a DNMC. :)', '2008-01-21 08:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
