(4412153, 635430, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very cold but also very "snap shotish". A little lighting will go a long way.  Try to use a side light without the camera flash to light you subject and it may add a bit more depth a bit better color.</td>', 'Very cold but also very "snap shotish". A little lighting will go a long way.  Try to use a side light without the camera flash to light you subject and it may add a bit more depth a bit better color.', '2008-01-21 21:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
