(4412236, 635460, 75651, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of firld actually disturbs the full image I feel.  The falloff really needs to be with all of them unless you are trying to single out a certain one because you want it too stand out.  Since they are all uniform, they all really need to be in focus.  Could have given this a much tighter crp as well.  Fill that frame with this shot.  Good use of lighting and shadows as well as color though.</td>', 'The shallow depth of firld actually disturbs the full image I feel.  The falloff really needs to be with all of them unless you are trying to single out a certain one because you want it too stand out.  Since they are all uniform, they all really need to be in focus.  Could have given this a much tighter crp as well.  Fill that frame with this shot.  Good use of lighting and shadows as well as color though.', '2008-01-21 22:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
