(4412906, 635497, 6999, '<td valign="top">Is this what HDR stuff does? I don''t know; seems like the foreground comes from a different picture than the sky, certainly a differently illuminated one. Not sure I like the effect.</td>', 'Is this what HDR stuff does? I don''t know; seems like the foreground comes from a different picture than the sky, certainly a differently illuminated one. Not sure I like the effect.', '2008-01-22 05:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412916, 635968, 6999, '<td valign="top">Horrible - in a fascinating way, that is. The implication of your title is certainly carried out in the image - the de-saturated parts of the arms seeming ly having the pallor of death and decay, especially enhanced by the flesh tones being so unaffected. I don''t like the metaphysical implications at all however - that implication that only in groups can we have any meaning is surely anathema: what possibility for individual genius in that world? If everything is concensus then everything is mediocre.</td>', 'Horrible - in a fascinating way, that is. The implication of your title is certainly carried out in the image - the de-saturated parts of the arms seeming ly having the pallor of death and decay, especially enhanced by the flesh tones being so unaffected. I don''t like the metaphysical implications at all however - that implication that only in groups can we have any meaning is surely anathema: what possibility for individual genius in that world? If everything is concensus then everything is mediocre.', '2008-01-22 05:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412920, 636079, 6999, '<td valign="top">The difference from the ''usual'' DPC water-drops refraction shot seems almost irrelevant, really. Good compositional eye, but not interesting to me.</td>', 'The difference from the ''usual'' DPC water-drops refraction shot seems almost irrelevant, really. Good compositional eye, but not interesting to me.', '2008-01-22 05:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412924, 635803, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great title: I wonder if it will only be me that finds an implication of the post-coital here? Kind of bland image however, but an intriguing thought is brought up.</td>', 'Great title: I wonder if it will only be me that finds an implication of the post-coital here? Kind of bland image however, but an intriguing thought is brought up.', '2008-01-22 05:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
