(4412931, 635702, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shooting; the cat/dog opposition is always amusing, and always seems to have something to say about the instinct v intellect opposition.</td>', 'Nice shooting; the cat/dog opposition is always amusing, and always seems to have something to say about the instinct v intellect opposition.', '2008-01-22 05:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412935, 636233, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the tonality here; but it''s only the technical facility that does anything for me, and I don''t, in the end, think that''s enough of itself.</td>', 'I like the tonality here; but it''s only the technical facility that does anything for me, and I don''t, in the end, think that''s enough of itself.', '2008-01-22 05:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412940, 635918, 6999, '<td valign="top">You have, at least, presumed some level of ability in the voters to work out what the ''six'' is here; I''m betting you''ll have underestimated the literalness of some assessors minds though. For myself, I find this a fairly bland still-life: lacking fine detail, a lumpy composition, and unsuccessful choice of colour combinations - that red background makes it hard for the real tones and quality of the leather to stand out.</td>', 'You have, at least, presumed some level of ability in the voters to work out what the ''six'' is here; I''m betting you''ll have underestimated the literalness of some assessors minds though. For myself, I find this a fairly bland still-life: lacking fine detail, a lumpy composition, and unsuccessful choice of colour combinations - that red background makes it hard for the real tones and quality of the leather to stand out.', '2008-01-22 05:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4412944, 635770, 6999, '<td valign="top">What a great camera; unsure about the posing here - it just brings questions about why she''s shooting without using the viewfinder, but I see your dilemma of course.</td>', 'What a great camera; unsure about the posing here - it just brings questions about why she''s shooting without using the viewfinder, but I see your dilemma of course.', '2008-01-22 05:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
