(4413195, 635751, 80859, '<td valign="top">this is by far the best of the lot including mine.  i thought i gave it a 10 in the first place, but luckily i was looking over everything and realized that somehow it was marked a ''1''!  it''s fixed.  definitely a 10 not a 1.  the lights are just beautiful and the light trails are perfectly placed.  i''ll be interested to know if it really is a 6 second exposure.</td>', 'this is by far the best of the lot including mine.  i thought i gave it a 10 in the first place, but luckily i was looking over everything and realized that somehow it was marked a ''1''!  it''s fixed.  definitely a 10 not a 1.  the lights are just beautiful and the light trails are perfectly placed.  i''ll be interested to know if it really is a 6 second exposure.', '2008-01-22 09:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413247, 636038, 72070, '<td valign="top">really nice lining up of the apples... I like the slight curve you brought to the line an the contrast between the green apples and the black backgrounf.. I would have used 6 similar apples as the 1st in the line...the others seem a little more on the yellow side</td>', 'really nice lining up of the apples... I like the slight curve you brought to the line an the contrast between the green apples and the black backgrounf.. I would have used 6 similar apples as the 1st in the line...the others seem a little more on the yellow side', '2008-01-22 09:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413254, 636233, 72070, '<td valign="top">great idea! maybe you could have placed the egg on a black background (it would pop out more I think) and try to paint some footprints of the "escapee" on the floor! would have been even more funny! the focus seems a bit off to me, but that could be due to compression... keep in mind to clean your surface before shooting! there''s a lot of dust on the table</td>', 'great idea! maybe you could have placed the egg on a black background (it would pop out more I think) and try to paint some footprints of the "escapee" on the floor! would have been even more funny! the focus seems a bit off to me, but that could be due to compression... keep in mind to clean your surface before shooting! there''s a lot of dust on the table', '2008-01-22 09:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
