(4420410, 636048, 78062, '<td valign="top">I like how it jumps out but i think the blur is too strong. Also, the border detracts my eye from the top. It''s alright though, but nothing special.</td>', 'I like how it jumps out but i think the blur is too strong. Also, the border detracts my eye from the top. It''s alright though, but nothing special.', '2008-01-24 06:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
