(4420416, 635924, 59293, '<td valign="top">I like this abstraction of sixness! The dramatic lighting emphasizes the repetition to give us rhythm.</td>', 'I like this abstraction of sixness! The dramatic lighting emphasizes the repetition to give us rhythm.', '2008-01-24 06:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420417, 636062, 78062, '<td valign="top">A bit cluttered, a bit soft, a bit flat. I think its cool how the background looks like water though, but i did immediately think this one would have worked better with somone at a table who had just stood up in excitement because they had rolled a bunch of sixes- it would have been harder I suppose but would have given it more of a human quality. This kinda looks like you''ve stumbled upon a bunch of dice on a table.<br/> <br/>If the border was bigger I think it would have helped strengthen it too, and make everything look a bit tighter.</td>', 'A bit cluttered, a bit soft, a bit flat. I think its cool how the background looks like water though, but i did immediately think this one would have worked better with somone at a table who had just stood up in excitement because they had rolled a bunch of sixes- it would have been harder I suppose but would have given it more of a human quality. This kinda looks like you''ve stumbled upon a bunch of dice on a table. If the border was bigger I think it would have helped strengthen it too, and make everything look a bit tighter.', '2008-01-24 06:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420419, 635968, 78062, '<td valign="top">This rules. Great idea. Nicely done too and great comp. You done good with the central crop and the colours are nice too.<br/> <br/>If i''m being nitpicky (which i am) I would suggest giving it all a bit mroe contrast to make the arms look a bit more rounded and to increase the tones of the black and white. Also, maybe having the other ''big hand'' at the top would have balanced it better. It looks like both the adult hands are at the bottom which makes it look a bit heavy down there. But still, it''s one of the most ''human'' images I''ve seen so far.<br/> <br/>Great title too :)</td>', 'This rules. Great idea. Nicely done too and great comp. You done good with the central crop and the colours are nice too. If i''m being nitpicky (which i am) I would suggest giving it all a bit mroe contrast to make the arms look a bit more rounded and to increase the tones of the black and white. Also, maybe having the other ''big hand'' at the top would have balanced it better. It looks like both the adult hands are at the bottom which makes it look a bit heavy down there. But still, it''s one of the most ''human'' images I''ve seen so far. Great title too :)', '2008-01-24 06:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420421, 636012, 78062, '<td valign="top">You have to look closely for the 6 here. I think of all the things you could have done with this, and all the ways you could have shot it, you didn''t go for the best one. The background is super busy, the exposure looks a bit bright, the details of the old pipe are hard to see and the dial is a bit lost all the way down there.<br/> <br/>Would it have worked better if the camera was positioned looking across the dial and up at the tap maybe?</td>', 'You have to look closely for the 6 here. I think of all the things you could have done with this, and all the ways you could have shot it, you didn''t go for the best one. The background is super busy, the exposure looks a bit bright, the details of the old pipe are hard to see and the dial is a bit lost all the way down there. Would it have worked better if the camera was positioned looking across the dial and up at the tap maybe?', '2008-01-24 06:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420423, 634815, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, ncie colours too. As a personal preference I would have liked the background to be darker to bring out the colours more and complement the reds more too. As it is, the brown looks a bit murky and doesn''t help things.<br/> <br/>Also, the sharpest bit in the image isn;t the berries it''s that little leaf where the twigs converge which draws my eye to it.<br/> <br/>It''s a good image, just nto a great one.</td>', 'Nice DOF, ncie colours too. As a personal preference I would have liked the background to be darker to bring out the colours more and complement the reds more too. As it is, the brown looks a bit murky and doesn''t help things. Also, the sharpest bit in the image isn;t the berries it''s that little leaf where the twigs converge which draws my eye to it. It''s a good image, just nto a great one.', '2008-01-24 06:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420425, 635688, 78062, '<td valign="top">strange crop. Nice negative space but I immediately thought the item would look better in the corner more. Cool colours though and i like the soft look of the light.<br/> <br/>Nice job :)</td>', 'strange crop. Nice negative space but I immediately thought the item would look better in the corner more. Cool colours though and i like the soft look of the light. Nice job :)', '2008-01-24 06:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
