(4420456, 635541, 79816, '<td valign="top">Great potential in this shot. The circle of light would be better if centered more over the 6 to provide symmetry. Perhaps also lower the exposure ever so slightly to remove harshness on the 6.</td>', 'Great potential in this shot. The circle of light would be better if centered more over the 6 to provide symmetry. Perhaps also lower the exposure ever so slightly to remove harshness on the 6.', '2008-01-24 07:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
