(4420492, 635916, 78062, '<td valign="top">I think you''re going to get a lot of 1''s for this. I''m not sure if anyone will go to the trouble to comment so i''ll see what I can do. The first thing struck me was that it looked like your monitor or camera screwed up the colours. My second thought was that this was terrible, and the main reason being that you had a nice pic, but ruined it with the colouring method. I think it would have worked with the glasses filled with red, green or blue liquid and then gone from there. As it is, it''s muddy, badly defined and it''s hard to see the shapes within the frame. I''m sure you had an idea in mind when you took the shot, but i''m not sure if this was it. But hey, i didn''t even enter!</td>', 'I think you''re going to get a lot of 1''s for this. I''m not sure if anyone will go to the trouble to comment so i''ll see what I can do. The first thing struck me was that it looked like your monitor or camera screwed up the colours. My second thought was that this was terrible, and the main reason being that you had a nice pic, but ruined it with the colouring method. I think it would have worked with the glasses filled with red, green or blue liquid and then gone from there. As it is, it''s muddy, badly defined and it''s hard to see the shapes within the frame. I''m sure you had an idea in mind when you took the shot, but i''m not sure if this was it. But hey, i didn''t even enter!', '2008-01-24 07:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420496, 635924, 78062, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the increase in scale, but i think the space at the top is superflous. Maybe if the urchins were aligned across the very top of the frame the shadows would merge with the darkness and would look a bit better? The greay at the top does nothing for me i''m afraid.</td>', 'I like the idea and the increase in scale, but i think the space at the top is superflous. Maybe if the urchins were aligned across the very top of the frame the shadows would merge with the darkness and would look a bit better? The greay at the top does nothing for me i''m afraid.', '2008-01-24 07:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420498, 636019, 78062, '<td valign="top">I don''t see it i''m afraid.</td>', 'I don''t see it i''m afraid.', '2008-01-24 07:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420500, 635672, 78062, '<td valign="top">another one!</td>', 'another one!', '2008-01-24 07:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420501, 634788, 78062, '<td valign="top">wrong challenge?</td>', 'wrong challenge?', '2008-01-24 07:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420506, 635862, 78062, '<td valign="top">lol, that''s ace. I love how the butter knives are used as claws :) Great expression too and good job on the sideburns. Shame there''s no yellow latex in there though, but hey...</td>', 'lol, that''s ace. I love how the butter knives are used as claws :) Great expression too and good job on the sideburns. Shame there''s no yellow latex in there though, but hey...', '2008-01-24 07:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420509, 635865, 78062, '<td valign="top">what happened to their faces?<br/> <br/>the crop here is too tight I think, it gives no sense of space or scale. The focus is way way off and the central horizon line i think is a bit thoughtless. Overall, it could have been great but there''s a few factors that hinder it severely.<br/> <br/>But seriously, what happened to their faces?</td>', 'what happened to their faces? the crop here is too tight I think, it gives no sense of space or scale. The focus is way way off and the central horizon line i think is a bit thoughtless. Overall, it could have been great but there''s a few factors that hinder it severely. But seriously, what happened to their faces?', '2008-01-24 07:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420512, 635471, 78062, '<td valign="top">OK, i get the 6 pack of beer and to an extent the lemons... but what''s with the river? My first thought was that it was rather weird and an odd juxtaposition of beer and river, and i was trying to find connections, but failed. It''s interesting, but confusing.</td>', 'OK, i get the 6 pack of beer and to an extent the lemons... but what''s with the river? My first thought was that it was rather weird and an odd juxtaposition of beer and river, and i was trying to find connections, but failed. It''s interesting, but confusing.', '2008-01-24 08:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420513, 635899, 78062, '<td valign="top">That''s weird... like a cloning factory has gone nuts on Tigger dolls.</td>', 'That''s weird... like a cloning factory has gone nuts on Tigger dolls.', '2008-01-24 08:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420645, 635006, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like this in black &amp; white, it keeps my focus on the distorted bottles. Good clarity and composition.</td>', 'I like this in black & white, it keeps my focus on the distorted bottles. Good clarity and composition.', '2008-01-24 08:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420652, 636066, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the neutral background. For me, it would be more interesting if perhaps the collectibles were groupd differently or if you took the photo from a different angle - maybe looking up or looking down at them.</td>', 'I like the neutral background. For me, it would be more interesting if perhaps the collectibles were groupd differently or if you took the photo from a different angle - maybe looking up or looking down at them.', '2008-01-24 08:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420662, 635219, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - I wonder how long you had to wait for six ducks to float by? I also like how the waterline is at the six and the reflection in the water. Good eye on seeing this.</td>', 'Lol - I wonder how long you had to wait for six ducks to float by? I also like how the waterline is at the six and the reflection in the water. Good eye on seeing this.', '2008-01-24 08:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420669, 636196, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - dang, I just drank my slim-fast, but boy do those look good! I like the composition and lighting, not to mention they really do look yummy.</td>', 'Lol - dang, I just drank my slim-fast, but boy do those look good! I like the composition and lighting, not to mention they really do look yummy.', '2008-01-24 08:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420675, 635173, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the color values you chose. The sky is a bit on the dark side for me, but otherwise a good photo.</td>', 'I like the color values you chose. The sky is a bit on the dark side for me, but otherwise a good photo.', '2008-01-24 08:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420682, 635809, 41675, '<td valign="top">If I place my left hand over the left side of your photo, cropping out the wood frame edge, I find I like it better. My favorite part is the light hitting the dice and marbles inside the jar.</td>', 'If I place my left hand over the left side of your photo, cropping out the wood frame edge, I find I like it better. My favorite part is the light hitting the dice and marbles inside the jar.', '2008-01-24 08:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420685, 635437, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - how funny. Your image makes ya look twice and then look down at your own keyboard to compare. :-)</td>', 'Lol - how funny. Your image makes ya look twice and then look down at your own keyboard to compare. :-)', '2008-01-24 08:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420689, 635921, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat close up. I like the texture.</td>', 'Neat close up. I like the texture.', '2008-01-24 08:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420693, 635938, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the whites are a little blown, but creative and "cool" looking. Excellent in black &amp; white.</td>', 'For me, the whites are a little blown, but creative and "cool" looking. Excellent in black & white.', '2008-01-24 08:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420695, 635113, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great complimentary colors and I like the simplicity of your image. Nicely done. You could do a whole series of numbers.</td>', 'Great complimentary colors and I like the simplicity of your image. Nicely done. You could do a whole series of numbers.', '2008-01-24 08:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420698, 635524, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good image. This would work well for a farming/co-op kind of advertising or produce commercial. Good skin tone and the black background keeps my focus on the hands and tomatoes.</td>', 'Good image. This would work well for a farming/co-op kind of advertising or produce commercial. Good skin tone and the black background keeps my focus on the hands and tomatoes.', '2008-01-24 08:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420701, 636119, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish there was just a bit more..."breathing room" around the edge instead of your border touching the cans. I think the black &amp; white works well here.</td>', 'For me, I wish there was just a bit more..."breathing room" around the edge instead of your border touching the cans. I think the black & white works well here.', '2008-01-24 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420703, 636012, 41675, '<td valign="top">It could be me, but I''m not sure how you saw this fitting in the challenge. Looking closely, the needle gage is on 5. Hmm. Perhaps if taken from a different angle or if it were changed to black &amp; white it would be more interesting to me. The background is busy and my eyes tend to wander all over your photo and not focus on your main subject.</td>', 'It could be me, but I''m not sure how you saw this fitting in the challenge. Looking closely, the needle gage is on 5. Hmm. Perhaps if taken from a different angle or if it were changed to black & white it would be more interesting to me. The background is busy and my eyes tend to wander all over your photo and not focus on your main subject.', '2008-01-24 09:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420706, 635154, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - how funny. I like the neutral color scheme</td>', 'Lol - how funny. I like the neutral color scheme', '2008-01-24 09:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420708, 636104, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good city life image and sense of movement. Busy photo, but interesting.</td>', 'Good city life image and sense of movement. Busy photo, but interesting.', '2008-01-24 09:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420709, 634945, 41675, '<td valign="top">pretty sunset. It looks so calm and srene - wish I was there. Too bad there weren''t just the six main palm trees. Good composition too.</td>', 'pretty sunset. It looks so calm and srene - wish I was there. Too bad there weren''t just the six main palm trees. Good composition too.', '2008-01-24 09:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420710, 634208, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice floral photo. Well composed, good colors and the black background really helps the colors pop. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice floral photo. Well composed, good colors and the black background really helps the colors pop. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-24 09:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420738, 635938, 61779, '<td valign="top">brilliant!</td>', 'brilliant!', '2008-01-24 09:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420818, 635751, 45790, '<td valign="top">Great take on theme. Good result.</td>', 'Great take on theme. Good result.', '2008-01-24 10:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420842, 636064, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for this challenge!  Not only does it honor DPC with the ever-loveable duckies, but the one looking up seals the deal.</td>', 'Nice idea for this challenge!  Not only does it honor DPC with the ever-loveable duckies, but the one looking up seals the deal.', '2008-01-24 10:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420851, 635702, 30982, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far.  Love the messed up panes!  Classic "heh - I''m in here where it''s warm and you are not!" versus "lemmeinlemmeinlemmein!"</td>', 'My favorite so far.  Love the messed up panes!  Classic "heh - I''m in here where it''s warm and you are not!" versus "lemmeinlemmeinlemmein!"', '2008-01-24 10:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420865, 634883, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2008-01-24 10:27:50.000000', NULL, 1);
