(4420870, 632931, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely collection of stuff, and a very nice approach to the challenge.</td>', 'A lovely collection of stuff, and a very nice approach to the challenge.', '2008-01-24 10:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420873, 636225, 30982, '<td valign="top">This definitely says "6" the loudest!</td>', 'This definitely says "6" the loudest!', '2008-01-24 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420874, 636048, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect!</td>', 'Perfect!', '2008-01-24 10:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420877, 634572, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait - very warm and fun.  Great idea for the challenge, too.</td>', 'Excellent portrait - very warm and fun.  Great idea for the challenge, too.', '2008-01-24 10:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420883, 636186, 30982, '<td valign="top">The six distinct drops are a very nice touch.  Well executed.</td>', 'The six distinct drops are a very nice touch.  Well executed.', '2008-01-24 10:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420884, 636067, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great texture - very nice choice of DOF.</td>', 'Great texture - very nice choice of DOF.', '2008-01-24 10:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421129, 635805, 85563, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the graininess... looks oversharpened.  Cool concept though.</td>', 'I don''t like the graininess... looks oversharpened.  Cool concept though.', '2008-01-24 11:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421243, 635688, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Great light and composition. It reminds me of the old Magic 8 ball I played with as a kid.</td>', 'Very nice image. Great light and composition. It reminds me of the old Magic 8 ball I played with as a kid.', '2008-01-24 11:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421261, 636021, 71608, '<td valign="top">I was about to say the old chestnut, ''more light'', when I realised I really actually quite like it! The muted tones make this simple and subtle, and I''m a fan :)</td>', 'I was about to say the old chestnut, ''more light'', when I realised I really actually quite like it! The muted tones make this simple and subtle, and I''m a fan :)', '2008-01-24 12:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421263, 635219, 71608, '<td valign="top">Haha, perfect timing!</td>', 'Haha, perfect timing!', '2008-01-24 12:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421290, 634201, 50034, '<td valign="top">Good Eye!  Excellent Photo!  Nice DOF!  :)</td>', 'Good Eye!  Excellent Photo!  Nice DOF!  :)', '2008-01-24 12:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421295, 635604, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF!</td>', 'Nice DOF!', '2008-01-24 12:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421300, 634812, 50034, '<td valign="top">Excellent Photo!  Great  DOF  :)</td>', 'Excellent Photo!  Great  DOF  :)', '2008-01-24 12:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421302, 635449, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great DOF!</td>', 'Great DOF!', '2008-01-24 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421311, 635865, 21029, '<td valign="top">The photo appears to be out of focus</td>', 'The photo appears to be out of focus', '2008-01-24 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421512, 635491, 59276, '<td valign="top">Great collection of people! I''m sure I will see a ribbon on it.....10</td>', 'Great collection of people! I''m sure I will see a ribbon on it.....10', '2008-01-24 13:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421740, 632931, 56502, '<td valign="top">I found it (maybe there are more?), but still the picture kind of messy.</td>', 'I found it (maybe there are more?), but still the picture kind of messy.', '2008-01-24 14:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421787, 636021, 56502, '<td valign="top">Just an idea - I think it would look better if the white were more white, less grey.</td>', 'Just an idea - I think it would look better if the white were more white, less grey.', '2008-01-24 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421797, 636140, 56502, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of style and colors.</td>', 'Nice contrast of style and colors.', '2008-01-24 14:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421803, 636079, 56502, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!</td>', 'Nice idea!', '2008-01-24 14:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421812, 635702, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the richness of the tones and the story that the cat and dog give to the image</td>', 'i love the richness of the tones and the story that the cat and dog give to the image', '2008-01-24 14:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421815, 635835, 67152, '<td valign="top">a very cool study of some great townhouses - gotta love the second from the right!</td>', 'a very cool study of some great townhouses - gotta love the second from the right!', '2008-01-24 14:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421818, 634982, 67152, '<td valign="top">the shallow dof/ blur is used so masterfully to focus and force our attention on the man crossing the street</td>', 'the shallow dof/ blur is used so masterfully to focus and force our attention on the man crossing the street', '2008-01-24 14:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421820, 635154, 67152, '<td valign="top">the repeating shapes throughout the image really draws me in - especially the layer of sidewalk, wall, faces and bricks</td>', 'the repeating shapes throughout the image really draws me in - especially the layer of sidewalk, wall, faces and bricks', '2008-01-24 14:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421824, 634815, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent control of DOF here - the smooth background so nicely offsets the sharpness of the twig with the berries</td>', 'excellent control of DOF here - the smooth background so nicely offsets the sharpness of the twig with the berries', '2008-01-24 14:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421827, 636051, 87539, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, just not so sure about the fabric underneath.</td>', 'I like the angle, just not so sure about the fabric underneath.', '2008-01-24 14:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421830, 635921, 67152, '<td valign="top">the repeating sixes and the red ink really grabbed my attention - i think the textures is what holds it</td>', 'the repeating sixes and the red ink really grabbed my attention - i think the textures is what holds it', '2008-01-24 14:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421831, 636143, 87539, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on 6!  That little piece of white coming out of the pocket is distracting.</td>', 'Interesting take on 6!  That little piece of white coming out of the pocket is distracting.', '2008-01-24 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421832, 635541, 87539, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, would like to see it more in focus.</td>', 'Interesting idea, would like to see it more in focus.', '2008-01-24 14:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421833, 636079, 67152, '<td valign="top">very good use of optical ''trickery'' to make this one shine - nice work</td>', 'very good use of optical ''trickery'' to make this one shine - nice work', '2008-01-24 14:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421834, 635006, 87539, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea for the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting idea for the challenge.', '2008-01-24 14:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421835, 635113, 67152, '<td valign="top">the smoothness of the lines really draws me into the image - and the choice of colors works very well</td>', 'the smoothness of the lines really draws me into the image - and the choice of colors works very well', '2008-01-24 14:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421838, 634572, 87539, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I like the different expression on each girl.</td>', 'Very cool, I like the different expression on each girl.', '2008-01-24 14:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421839, 636022, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the simplicity of this image - i think a bit more contrast would have really made this one jump for me (but i like high contrast!)</td>', 'i like the simplicity of this image - i think a bit more contrast would have really made this one jump for me (but i like high contrast!)', '2008-01-24 14:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421841, 636067, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent macro study - the textures are really emphasized by the b/w choice - good work</td>', 'excellent macro study - the textures are really emphasized by the b/w choice - good work', '2008-01-24 14:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421847, 635862, 87539, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!  <br/> <br/> <br/>P.S.  Tape is showing on the left hand....</td>', 'Neat idea!    P.S.  Tape is showing on the left hand....', '2008-01-24 15:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421850, 636104, 67152, '<td valign="top">fantastic kinetic shot created by the wide angle - the emergency vehicle on the far right adds a lot of great interest to the shot for me - nice find!</td>', 'fantastic kinetic shot created by the wide angle - the emergency vehicle on the far right adds a lot of great interest to the shot for me - nice find!', '2008-01-24 15:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421867, 635605, 87539, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the textures here.</td>', 'I like how you captured the textures here.', '2008-01-24 15:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421889, 635751, 67152, '<td valign="top">this is what i call an out of the box approach - and I like!  good colors and i love the control of exposure to avoid blown out lights</td>', 'this is what i call an out of the box approach - and I like!  good colors and i love the control of exposure to avoid blown out lights', '2008-01-24 15:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421892, 635820, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely simple approach - the spray of tulips works really well to fill the frame</td>', 'lovely simple approach - the spray of tulips works really well to fill the frame', '2008-01-24 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421897, 635499, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of repeating shapes and the placement of the extra petals</td>', 'I like the choice of repeating shapes and the placement of the extra petals', '2008-01-24 15:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421903, 635122, 67152, '<td valign="top">But I see 12 nuts????!! LOL - nice image - the reflections to create interest (and little eights) are great.  Don''t forget this idea when the 8 challenge comes up - it would be perfect</td>', 'But I see 12 nuts????!! LOL - nice image - the reflections to create interest (and little eights) are great.  Don''t forget this idea when the 8 challenge comes up - it would be perfect', '2008-01-24 15:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421905, 635223, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice use of out of focus background to create the context for the shot - good work and extremely well delivered.</td>', 'nice use of out of focus background to create the context for the shot - good work and extremely well delivered.', '2008-01-24 15:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421934, 636066, 67152, '<td valign="top">Those are some silly characters!  I am not sold on the background and the choice of crop makes it seem stale and flat.  Often, shooting straight onto the subject gives a very static feel - more of a perspective shot using angles could really give this subject some pop.</td>', 'Those are some silly characters!  I am not sold on the background and the choice of crop makes it seem stale and flat.  Often, shooting straight onto the subject gives a very static feel - more of a perspective shot using angles could really give this subject some pop.', '2008-01-24 15:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421941, 635871, 67152, '<td valign="top">good effort with the fill the frame - but I am afraid that the lighting - very harsh - makes the sauce and meatballs come across as rather unappetising.  Softer light (bigger light source with diffuser) and better control of exposure on the sauce should help out.  Food is a tough subject to photograph well.</td>', 'good effort with the fill the frame - but I am afraid that the lighting - very harsh - makes the sauce and meatballs come across as rather unappetising.  Softer light (bigger light source with diffuser) and better control of exposure on the sauce should help out.  Food is a tough subject to photograph well.', '2008-01-24 15:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421944, 632931, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the forgotten feel and the earth tones a great deal - good job to avoid the typical ''bright and shiny'' dpc approach.  good find on the six!</td>', 'i like the forgotten feel and the earth tones a great deal - good job to avoid the typical ''bright and shiny'' dpc approach.  good find on the six!', '2008-01-24 15:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421946, 636002, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really like the riders a lot - they have a great edge to them - and the sky and ground do a great job of framing them</td>', 'i really like the riders a lot - they have a great edge to them - and the sky and ground do a great job of framing them', '2008-01-24 15:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421949, 635938, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent high contrast image - the six dots is awesome - i just wish the reflection in the glass lens on the right was not there</td>', 'excellent high contrast image - the six dots is awesome - i just wish the reflection in the glass lens on the right was not there', '2008-01-24 15:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421954, 635006, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent use of backlighting to provide a great deal of contrast to the shot - the choice of wide angle is on the money</td>', 'excellent use of backlighting to provide a great deal of contrast to the shot - the choice of wide angle is on the money', '2008-01-24 15:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421958, 635604, 67152, '<td valign="top">i hope you are not getting killed for this shot - i find this engaging and so energetic  - the smile on the dog''s face and the OOF smile on the person  behind is fantastic - back for a comment and a bump!</td>', 'i hope you are not getting killed for this shot - i find this engaging and so energetic  - the smile on the dog''s face and the OOF smile on the person  behind is fantastic - back for a comment and a bump!', '2008-01-24 15:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
