(4423965, 635822, 89421, '<td valign="top">This picture was very thought out. It has great color contrast which makes the focal point, the flower really stand out. I like that way the backround is black and the flower is a bright pink, its very eye catching. It really makes the picture. Also I liked how the focal point isnt busy, it has detail but not to much to distract the person looking at it. It makes it so your eye really catches the natural beauty of this shot.</td>', 'This picture was very thought out. It has great color contrast which makes the focal point, the flower really stand out. I like that way the backround is black and the flower is a bright pink, its very eye catching. It really makes the picture. Also I liked how the focal point isnt busy, it has detail but not to much to distract the person looking at it. It makes it so your eye really catches the natural beauty of this shot.', '2008-01-25 10:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4423966, 635499, 89421, '<td valign="top">This picture is very playful. When I look at this picture it makes me happy. The colors and the patterns really give you a great feelings when seeing this picture. The flowers were a great idea to be the focal point and the pattern is excellent.</td>', 'This picture is very playful. When I look at this picture it makes me happy. The colors and the patterns really give you a great feelings when seeing this picture. The flowers were a great idea to be the focal point and the pattern is excellent.', '2008-01-25 10:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4423967, 635805, 89421, '<td valign="top">This picture is very creative. It has two focal points, one being the cards the other one being the dice. I like how it has a repeating pattern with the cards (6666) and then the dice in front of it showing three on one and three on the other dice which equals six which I think is very creative. Also in the cery front on a different side of the dice it also shows six. So you can tell this picture was very thought out and i love how its just black and white, it really makes you see what the focal point is.</td>', 'This picture is very creative. It has two focal points, one being the cards the other one being the dice. I like how it has a repeating pattern with the cards (6666) and then the dice in front of it showing three on one and three on the other dice which equals six which I think is very creative. Also in the cery front on a different side of the dice it also shows six. So you can tell this picture was very thought out and i love how its just black and white, it really makes you see what the focal point is.', '2008-01-25 10:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4423968, 635535, 89421, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. I like the color combination. It gives the picture a rugged look. Also it gives you a peaceful kind of feeling, whenever your on a beach its peaceful and relaxing and this really represents that. I love the angle which this is shot. I love how its captured with him walking and holding the gatar. Great work</td>', 'Very nice image. I like the color combination. It gives the picture a rugged look. Also it gives you a peaceful kind of feeling, whenever your on a beach its peaceful and relaxing and this really represents that. I love the angle which this is shot. I love how its captured with him walking and holding the gatar. Great work', '2008-01-25 10:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4423969, 636004, 89421, '<td valign="top">The color combination in this shot is very well thought through. I like how every color has three of the same color. I like the shape that it made. The color in the backround really makes the balls stand out, pop!</td>', 'The color combination in this shot is very well thought through. I like how every color has three of the same color. I like the shape that it made. The color in the backround really makes the balls stand out, pop!', '2008-01-25 10:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4423970, 635122, 89421, '<td valign="top">This shot is very unique in the fact of the objects are very small at the top of the picture and as you look down the picture they size increases as the objects increase so do the colors. It starts out with a light blue and then gradually gets darker. Very unique thought.</td>', 'This shot is very unique in the fact of the objects are very small at the top of the picture and as you look down the picture they size increases as the objects increase so do the colors. It starts out with a light blue and then gradually gets darker. Very unique thought.', '2008-01-25 10:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4423971, 636066, 89421, '<td valign="top">I dont think this picute is very good. As much as I do love Shrek this picture to me isnt really art. I feel like this is a  picture that I would randomly take at my house. It doesnt seem like to much thought went into this accept to line all them up in a row and have all the characters from Shrek involved in the picture.</td>', 'I dont think this picute is very good. As much as I do love Shrek this picture to me isnt really art. I feel like this is a  picture that I would randomly take at my house. It doesnt seem like to much thought went into this accept to line all them up in a row and have all the characters from Shrek involved in the picture.', '2008-01-25 10:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4423975, 636210, 89421, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good picture to represent and outcast. It has all yellow ducks in one area and then a green duck way in the back of the picture. I like how they used to different colors to represent what they were trying to get across because you can really see the point of the picture as if they were to put a yellow duck in the back I dont think it would have captured the point as well.</td>', 'I think this is a good picture to represent and outcast. It has all yellow ducks in one area and then a green duck way in the back of the picture. I like how they used to different colors to represent what they were trying to get across because you can really see the point of the picture as if they were to put a yellow duck in the back I dont think it would have captured the point as well.', '2008-01-25 10:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4423976, 634945, 89426, '<td valign="top">This picture is very beautiful. I think that this is nature at it''s finest and you captured it. The colors are very bright and creates an illusion.</td>', 'This picture is very beautiful. I think that this is nature at it''s finest and you captured it. The colors are very bright and creates an illusion.', '2008-01-25 10:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4424022, 633491, 67152, '<td valign="top">it sure is sixes - the image seems a bit grainy and the composition overall seems a little lacking - using another background other than a plate may have worked a lot better.  It was a nice touch to add the DPC banner, but the print seems a bit blurry and it loses a bit of appeal.</td>', 'it sure is sixes - the image seems a bit grainy and the composition overall seems a little lacking - using another background other than a plate may have worked a lot better.  It was a nice touch to add the DPC banner, but the print seems a bit blurry and it loses a bit of appeal.', '2008-01-25 10:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
