(4427279, 635962, 33361, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing by the candle-drippings that it took a while to get the shot. . . I like the photo overall except for that</td>', 'I''m guessing by the candle-drippings that it took a while to get the shot. . . I like the photo overall except for that', '2008-01-26 19:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427283, 635899, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  maybe a little (excuse me) fuzzy...</td>', 'Great idea!  maybe a little (excuse me) fuzzy...', '2008-01-26 20:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427557, 635532, 42984, '<td valign="top">Strong commercial image!  This has the quality and style of an image that would be commissionedd by BMW for an M-series brochure.<br/> <br/>It''s not only the mono, which appears much more effective than colour would, but it is the subtle but even use of light.  the intakes all get the same shape because the light is spot on.  The cam cover has that lovely receeding tone that make the engine look like it goes on forever.<br/> <br/>Less is often mpre and this image demonstrates that perrfectly</td>', 'Strong commercial image!  This has the quality and style of an image that would be commissionedd by BMW for an M-series brochure. It''s not only the mono, which appears much more effective than colour would, but it is the subtle but even use of light.  the intakes all get the same shape because the light is spot on.  The cam cover has that lovely receeding tone that make the engine look like it goes on forever. Less is often mpre and this image demonstrates that perrfectly', '2008-01-26 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427564, 636055, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  the peppermint twist treatment is 100% spot on for the era and the tone of the message.<br/> <br/>It just shows you what difference attention to detail makes.  When I saw the tumbnail. it looked like a roadside snapshot &lt;yawn&gt; ... now it looks like a photjournalism shot illustrating a story in a quality magazine</td>', 'Nicely done!  the peppermint twist treatment is 100% spot on for the era and the tone of the message. It just shows you what difference attention to detail makes.  When I saw the tumbnail. it looked like a roadside snapshot <yawn> ... now it looks like a photjournalism shot illustrating a story in a quality magazine', '2008-01-26 22:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427566, 636061, 42984, '<td valign="top">I''d like to help here but I''m not quite sure what to offer.  It''s hard to find a point of reference or interest in the image as presented.  Yes, it IS 6 of something but we have no way of knowing what that ''someting'' might be</td>', 'I''d like to help here but I''m not quite sure what to offer.  It''s hard to find a point of reference or interest in the image as presented.  Yes, it IS 6 of something but we have no way of knowing what that ''someting'' might be', '2008-01-26 22:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427568, 636210, 42984, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2008-01-26 22:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427570, 635772, 42984, '<td valign="top">I think for this to work properly, the six panes had to be symetrical and I think it loses impact because of that.  <br/> <br/>The colour, toning and imagery are very strong but just lack "impact"</td>', 'I think for this to work properly, the six panes had to be symetrical and I think it loses impact because of that.   The colour, toning and imagery are very strong but just lack "impact"', '2008-01-26 23:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427575, 636145, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, highlights almost blown around the nose although it may not have looked like that before you uploaded it.  I love the clarity of the hoodie''s stitching, I keep getting drawn to it.  Would be interesting to see it a stop or stop and a half darker</td>', 'Nice and sharp, highlights almost blown around the nose although it may not have looked like that before you uploaded it.  I love the clarity of the hoodie''s stitching, I keep getting drawn to it.  Would be interesting to see it a stop or stop and a half darker', '2008-01-26 23:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427583, 633249, 42984, '<td valign="top">I didn''t ''get'' it for a long time.  I kept thinking that if you meant they were a graphic representation of a 6 then the top two would have curved to the right.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure how many camera and light angles you tried here to add some perspective ... but I have the feeling that there is more there somewhere :)</td>', 'I didn''t ''get'' it for a long time.  I kept thinking that if you meant they were a graphic representation of a 6 then the top two would have curved to the right. I''m not sure how many camera and light angles you tried here to add some perspective ... but I have the feeling that there is more there somewhere :)', '2008-01-26 23:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427589, 635122, 42984, '<td valign="top">Superb.  I think I could happily have an A1 print of that on my wall.  The symetry, colour and toning are all damn fine work. The only thing that demotes it from a 10 to a 9 is the mirror - and that''s not your fault.<br/> <br/>Because the silver backing is throwint the double reflection which just spoils it a little but I know that a surface mirror or polished metal or using water is the stuff of commercial photography and not DPC</td>', 'Superb.  I think I could happily have an A1 print of that on my wall.  The symetry, colour and toning are all damn fine work. The only thing that demotes it from a 10 to a 9 is the mirror - and that''s not your fault. Because the silver backing is throwint the double reflection which just spoils it a little but I know that a surface mirror or polished metal or using water is the stuff of commercial photography and not DPC', '2008-01-26 23:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427591, 634208, 42984, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Perhaps a little too centred for my taste, I might have felt like another point had it maybe been hard left in frame</td>', 'Lovely.  Perhaps a little too centred for my taste, I might have felt like another point had it maybe been hard left in frame', '2008-01-26 23:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427595, 634211, 42984, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I''m struggling to find a ''point'' to the pic even though I like the imagery.  It might be the distraction of the stuff to the right of the register that is distracting</td>', 'Hmm, I''m struggling to find a ''point'' to the pic even though I like the imagery.  It might be the distraction of the stuff to the right of the register that is distracting', '2008-01-26 23:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427601, 636012, 42984, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Weird and interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.  Weird and interesting.', '2008-01-26 23:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427605, 635173, 42984, '<td valign="top">I''m personally fond of high contrast architectural shots. For comparison, I''d really like to see this also without the tilt or without the right hand building too.</td>', 'I''m personally fond of high contrast architectural shots. For comparison, I''d really like to see this also without the tilt or without the right hand building too.', '2008-01-26 23:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427610, 636021, 42984, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this quite works.  The very flat contrast has made it have a sort of flat impact.  What does a higher contrast one look like?</td>', 'I''m not sure this quite works.  The very flat contrast has made it have a sort of flat impact.  What does a higher contrast one look like?', '2008-01-26 23:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427652, 636087, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a strooong image:)  The limited lighting, the mood and the aged patina of the clock all work.  I usually don''t like centred images, I don''t think it''s wrong in this case at all.</td>', 'This is a strooong image:)  The limited lighting, the mood and the aged patina of the clock all work.  I usually don''t like centred images, I don''t think it''s wrong in this case at all.', '2008-01-26 23:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427658, 635604, 42984, '<td valign="top">Actually a great shot using depth of field  (bokeh) and shutter speed.  It''s a pity that it''s really a bit of a stretch for this challenge.</td>', 'Actually a great shot using depth of field  (bokeh) and shutter speed.  It''s a pity that it''s really a bit of a stretch for this challenge.', '2008-01-26 23:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427665, 635483, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  Very creative.  Photographically not strong for me, I''m thinking more impact would be had from a black background.  What looks to be happening is that the white is reflecting ''fill'' into all the cranes and flattening it</td>', 'Nice work.  Very creative.  Photographically not strong for me, I''m thinking more impact would be had from a black background.  What looks to be happening is that the white is reflecting ''fill'' into all the cranes and flattening it', '2008-01-26 23:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427667, 632931, 42984, '<td valign="top">Creative idea and quite a nice editing treatment</td>', 'Creative idea and quite a nice editing treatment', '2008-01-26 23:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427672, 635169, 42984, '<td valign="top">The caption actually spoils the image I think (no points lost though).<br/> <br/>The brass/gold/brown tonings and the subtle and economical use of light really work here.</td>', 'The caption actually spoils the image I think (no points lost though). The brass/gold/brown tonings and the subtle and economical use of light really work here.', '2008-01-26 23:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427677, 635865, 42984, '<td valign="top">The camera blur and perhaps the over-saturation have soiled this a bit but I like what you were trying to do here</td>', 'The camera blur and perhaps the over-saturation have soiled this a bit but I like what you were trying to do here', '2008-01-26 23:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427708, 634828, 42984, '<td valign="top">Very strongly on-challenge.  If I was looking for an image to caption the DPC 6 years, this would be it.</td>', 'Very strongly on-challenge.  If I was looking for an image to caption the DPC 6 years, this would be it.', '2008-01-26 23:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427812, 635223, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you achieved here. The dice really stands out.</td>', 'I like the effect you achieved here. The dice really stands out.', '2008-01-27 00:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427818, 636104, 22970, '<td valign="top">More than just a picture of "6". I like the movement and prospective.</td>', 'More than just a picture of "6". I like the movement and prospective.', '2008-01-27 00:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427829, 635862, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, focus, and setup. The visible tape on the hand to the right of the picture is distracting to me. Other than that a very nice setup.</td>', 'Nice lighting, focus, and setup. The visible tape on the hand to the right of the picture is distracting to me. Other than that a very nice setup.', '2008-01-27 00:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427949, 635122, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like the cool blue tone. Nice symmetry. The reflections, being doubled, is a little distracting. I wish the reflections could of been a sharp as the hex nut. Still a good shot.</td>', 'I like the cool blue tone. Nice symmetry. The reflections, being doubled, is a little distracting. I wish the reflections could of been a sharp as the hex nut. Still a good shot.', '2008-01-27 01:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427961, 636087, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, meets challenge, good DOF but the subject is not very interesting. With that said I think you did a good job. I think if the hands of the clock would of been set at a different time instead of 12, it may have added another element and would have made the subject more interesting.</td>', 'Nice texture, meets challenge, good DOF but the subject is not very interesting. With that said I think you did a good job. I think if the hands of the clock would of been set at a different time instead of 12, it may have added another element and would have made the subject more interesting.', '2008-01-27 01:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427966, 634201, 22970, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Simple but effective with nice detail, DOF, and lighting.</td>', 'Great photo. Simple but effective with nice detail, DOF, and lighting.', '2008-01-27 01:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428133, 635900, 68769, '<td valign="top">I like the curves here, but everything draws my eye towards the center then  back at me to the bottom of the guitar. Possibility a slight focal change could take the eye forward into infinity might have helped make it artistic.</td>', 'I like the curves here, but everything draws my eye towards the center then  back at me to the bottom of the guitar. Possibility a slight focal change could take the eye forward into infinity might have helped make it artistic.', '2008-01-27 06:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428135, 636156, 68769, '<td valign="top">I like this, the only nick I can find is the money is a little too neat. Good job.</td>', 'I like this, the only nick I can find is the money is a little too neat. Good job.', '2008-01-27 06:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428137, 635671, 68769, '<td valign="top">The title ? But that matters little when the image holds its own. Fantastic image.</td>', 'The title ? But that matters little when the image holds its own. Fantastic image.', '2008-01-27 06:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
