(4428287, 635006, 88241, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I would have liked it better if you had done the labels in color leaving the rest in B&amp;W. Still cool the way you shot it. Great DOF too.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I would have liked it better if you had done the labels in color leaving the rest in B&W. Still cool the way you shot it. Great DOF too.', '2008-01-27 09:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
