(4428998, 634602, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot! I suggest you try a crop of the just to the right of the stop sign, giving the shot symmetry with the phone posts (rather than having the extra one fore left) and losing the stop sign. I think this would give more the idea of chasing down the road after the balloon, and get the balloon out of horizontal dead center as a bonus. Your clouds are great, and I love the late afternoon (I presume - could be early morning, but...) sun. Focus seems like it could be a bit sharper. Some will probably complain about shoehorning the shot in with the title...</td>', 'What a fun shot! I suggest you try a crop of the just to the right of the stop sign, giving the shot symmetry with the phone posts (rather than having the extra one fore left) and losing the stop sign. I think this would give more the idea of chasing down the road after the balloon, and get the balloon out of horizontal dead center as a bonus. Your clouds are great, and I love the late afternoon (I presume - could be early morning, but...) sun. Focus seems like it could be a bit sharper. Some will probably complain about shoehorning the shot in with the title...', '2008-01-27 13:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429003, 635077, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and a good concept.  I don''t like the strong contrasts in this and would have liked (perhaps) to see more of the reflection on the table (but that would have thrown off your composition I suppose).</td>', 'Nicely composed and a good concept.  I don''t like the strong contrasts in this and would have liked (perhaps) to see more of the reflection on the table (but that would have thrown off your composition I suppose).', '2008-01-27 13:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
