(4430832, 635464, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top ten star, and of course for an excellent image. I love the light and composition.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top ten star, and of course for an excellent image. I love the light and composition.', '2008-01-28 00:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
