(4430867, 635122, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey, nice breakout from your usual style, Jason.  I like how you used the multiple exposures to increase DOF, too.  I''m going to have to remember that technique when I next shoot macro.  I know you''re not nuts about 4th, but I''ll say congrats anyway. :)</td>', 'Hey, nice breakout from your usual style, Jason.  I like how you used the multiple exposures to increase DOF, too.  I''m going to have to remember that technique when I next shoot macro.  I know you''re not nuts about 4th, but I''ll say congrats anyway. :)', '2008-01-28 00:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
