(4430888, 635464, 60862, '<td valign="top">Why, you sneak!  Going off and shooting a beautiful still life without even telling us about it. :)  Congrats on your high placement!</td>', 'Why, you sneak!  Going off and shooting a beautiful still life without even telling us about it. :)  Congrats on your high placement!', '2008-01-28 00:42:24.000000', NULL, 0),
