(4432397, 635770, 42196, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by e301:</b></div><hr/><i> ...unsure about the posing here - it just brings questions about why she''s shooting without using the viewfinder, but I see your dilemma of course. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It looks to me like she just finished snapping a shot and is giving somewhat of a coy "I gotcha" look.<br/>Really like this, wonder if a little warmth would approach more of a 60s color feel?</td>', 'Originally posted by e301: ...unsure about the posing here - it just brings questions about why she''s shooting without using the viewfinder, but I see your dilemma of course.   It looks to me like she just finished snapping a shot and is giving somewhat of a coy "I gotcha" look.Really like this, wonder if a little warmth would approach more of a 60s color feel?', '2008-01-28 10:51:48.000000', NULL, 0),
