(4432571, 635865, 67697, '<td valign="top">So I just came from your black and white bug photo to this shot of sheep with black and white faces.  lol what a transition.  Did you take this from a car window?  I don''t know why but that is what the blur reminds me of.  Get a zoom lens for your camera and get a close up of one of the faces - I bet that would be pretty interesting.</td>', 'So I just came from your black and white bug photo to this shot of sheep with black and white faces.  lol what a transition.  Did you take this from a car window?  I don''t know why but that is what the blur reminds me of.  Get a zoom lens for your camera and get a close up of one of the faces - I bet that would be pretty interesting.', '2008-01-28 11:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432579, 634201, 67697, '<td valign="top">I loved seeing this one in the challenge.  It was so arty and subtle.  And it did very well!  A top 10!  That is awesome.  Nice job getting this beautiful photo.</td>', 'I loved seeing this one in the challenge.  It was so arty and subtle.  And it did very well!  A top 10!  That is awesome.  Nice job getting this beautiful photo.', '2008-01-28 11:39:36.000000', NULL, 0),
