(4432643, 636061, 67697, '<td valign="top">I came really close to commenting on this during the challenge because I wanted to know what these were.  I like the metallic look of this.  And the thing in the bottom right looks like it has eyes lol.</td>', 'I came really close to commenting on this during the challenge because I wanted to know what these were.  I like the metallic look of this.  And the thing in the bottom right looks like it has eyes lol.', '2008-01-28 11:50:57.000000', NULL, 0),
