(4433125, 635968, 85886, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot - a bit surprised it didn''t feature a lot higher in the ranking.  It''s a bold statement.  I gave this a 9...for me the desaturation only served to move focus to the togetherness of the hands, rather than weirdly discolourised forearms.  I reckon you''d do really well at a stock photography place with this image...(team work, togetherness etc).</td>', 'I really liked this shot - a bit surprised it didn''t feature a lot higher in the ranking.  It''s a bold statement.  I gave this a 9...for me the desaturation only served to move focus to the togetherness of the hands, rather than weirdly discolourised forearms.  I reckon you''d do really well at a stock photography place with this image...(team work, togetherness etc).', '2008-01-28 13:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
