(4434765, 635772, 66494, '<td valign="top">Actually, Don, with a background in art I can tell you this person does not understand impact. My art teacher''s best quote (and most impactful) was "symmetry is the kiss of death". <br/>I believe your shot worked so well because it wasn''t symetric. Further, I think the lighting is amazing. <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KiwiShotz:</b></div><hr/><i> I think for this to work properly, the six panes had to be symetrical and I think it loses impact because of that.  <br/> <br/>The colour, toning and imagery are very strong but just lack "impact" </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Actually, Don, with a background in art I can tell you this person does not understand impact. My art teacher''s best quote (and most impactful) was "symmetry is the kiss of death". I believe your shot worked so well because it wasn''t symetric. Further, I think the lighting is amazing.  Originally posted by KiwiShotz: I think for this to work properly, the six panes had to be symetrical and I think it loses impact because of that.   The colour, toning and imagery are very strong but just lack "impact" ', '2008-01-28 20:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434818, 634572, 714, '<td valign="top">This would have been 1st place if the shirts were all solid colors..I have a hard time focusing on their faces without my eyes going back to the shirts.  I really like the unity here.  Very strong friendships here.</td>', 'This would have been 1st place if the shirts were all solid colors..I have a hard time focusing on their faces without my eyes going back to the shirts.  I really like the unity here.  Very strong friendships here.', '2008-01-28 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434931, 634201, 61651, '<td valign="top">Juli, this is such a lovely photo - the depth of field is just right, I like how all the outer edges fade and melt into the background, gives the inner "6" that much more impact.  Congratulations on a deserved top 10 - so glad to see this was one of yours!</td>', 'Juli, this is such a lovely photo - the depth of field is just right, I like how all the outer edges fade and melt into the background, gives the inner "6" that much more impact.  Congratulations on a deserved top 10 - so glad to see this was one of yours!', '2008-01-28 21:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
