(4436760, 634602, 88575, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by basssman7:</b></div><hr/><i> title dependent.  no sixes in the picture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>six poles on each side.  six lights at top of trailer.  six reflectors on bumper.</td>', 'Originally posted by basssman7: title dependent.  no sixes in the picture.   six poles on each side.  six lights at top of trailer.  six reflectors on bumper.', '2008-01-29 14:13:46.000000', NULL, 0),
