(4439481, 636085, 32767, '<td valign="top">Super Duper!<br/> <br/>Blows  <a href="//pawdrix.zenfolio.com/p706102902/?photo=h1EDE001F#517865503" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">my cupcake </a>  shot out of the water. I''d say the #6 pushed you into a compositional situation that might not have been the best for the overall shot but the treatment is stunning nione the less.<br/> <br/>Cheers!<br/></td>', 'Super Duper! Blows  my cupcake   shot out of the water. I''d say the #6 pushed you into a compositional situation that might not have been the best for the overall shot but the treatment is stunning nione the less. Cheers!', '2008-01-30 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 0),
