(4703127, 634201, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the warm golden tones in this composition. Shells and the beach always invoke warm thoughts - and the golden hue of this shell compliments the thought. Details &amp; lighting are wonderful. Arrangement of the major element is pleasing to the eye for the eye just follows the lines of the spiral on the shell as it curls inward. A lovely nature-found 6 nestled in the sand.</td>', 'Love the warm golden tones in this composition. Shells and the beach always invoke warm thoughts - and the golden hue of this shell compliments the thought. Details & lighting are wonderful. Arrangement of the major element is pleasing to the eye for the eye just follows the lines of the spiral on the shell as it curls inward. A lovely nature-found 6 nestled in the sand.', '2008-05-14 23:16:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703362, 636067, 60862, '<td valign="top">Another one going in my faves.  This could be/should be a poster!  Once again, you demonstrate your eye for composition and the use of B&amp;W to emphasize shapes and tones.</td>', 'Another one going in my faves.  This could be/should be a poster!  Once again, you demonstrate your eye for composition and the use of B&W to emphasize shapes and tones.', '2008-05-15 00:54:11.000000', NULL, 0),
